 weight in chocolate and didn't feel guilty about any of it bc it was so. damn. good. #gimmemore"},{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","review_id":"fU9R3G53_sQ6GxEVHQEcNw","date":"2015-11-22T13:34:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.906714141368866,"text_excerpt":"I'm in love!! Seriously! Iced coffee with that flavor? Not watered down? Not bland? I'm in love. I wish I could have went there again, but my buddies wanted to try as many different places as possible. I can't blame them, but I would have definitely went here again and again!!! Starwhats??"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","photo_id":"Yd3Kz7CzUVpDw7pl1TVU3w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Yd3Kz7CzUVpDw7pl1TVU3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8967782258987427},{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","photo_id":"gKQhEAFM8w1KpfcoirxyJg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gKQhEAFM8w1KpfcoirxyJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8720227479934692},{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","photo_id":"WmBDLOdIOppJr1bZDDIKOw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WmBDLOdIOppJr1bZDDIKOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8442704677581787},{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","photo_id":"kJ6-chXflxnCW32XUCEL1w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kJ6-chXflxnCW32XUCEL1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8024879693984985},{"business_id":"xdIUHgxMScxlGiiEdwsgnA","photo_id":"nBswPaqDT_gd6xrNlWPsZg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nBswPaqDT_gd6xrNlWPsZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7912580966949463}]},"notebook_case":null}
